[et_pb_section fb_built="1" admin_label="RM Domain Hero" _builder_version="4.27.4" use_custom_width="on" width_unit="off" custom_width_px="100%" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_row _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="100%" use_custom_gutter="on" gutter_width="1" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code admin_label="RM Domain Hero — Code" _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<!-- ============================================================
     RM HERO DOMINIO — Hero de la página "Dominio" (Divi 5, Code Module)
     Marca: Rodmedia · Reestructuración web
     Mismo sistema que los heros de inicio, tienda y diseño web: fondo
     #0f0f1e, línea superior con brillo, partículas conectadas, dos
     glows difuminados, Playfair Display + Inter (con eje itálico real
     cargado desde el principio — evita el recorte de letras altas en
     cursiva que ya apareció en los otros dos heros), badge con punto
     parpadeante, degradado de marca a 135deg, entrada en scroll.

     El buscador de dominios en vivo (RDAP/WHOIS) se probó y no se pudo
     verificar desde este entorno — sandbox sin salida real a internet,
     ver el hilo de la conversación — así que se ha quitado por ahora.
     rm-domain-check.php ya no se usa aquí; queda fuera del repo.
     En su lugar hay dos CTA normales, mismo patrón que el resto de
     heros. El texto del principal ("Ver precios de dominios") es el
     que ya traía el enlace secundario original — decide tú si encaja
     o prefieres otro. El del secundario ("Reservar una llamada") es
     copy nuevo, tomado del mismo texto que usan los heros de inicio y
     web — cámbialo si no es el que quieres aquí.

     Historia del mockup (misma estructura que en tienda y web, con
     otro final): se escribe un dominio, se confirma que está libre y
     se conecta con el resto de servicios (web, correo). Sigue siendo
     solo una animación de bucle, nunca dependió del buscador real, así
     que se queda igual.

     ANTES DE PUBLICAR:
     1) Cambia "X €/año" por el precio real de registro.
     2) Cambia el href de "Ver precios de dominios", "Reservar una
        llamada" y el botón "Registrarlo con Rodmedia" del mockup por
        tus anclas o páginas reales.
     3) Si ya cargas Playfair Display / Inter desde el Theme Builder de
        Divi, borra el @import de aquí para evitar cargarlas dos veces.
     ============================================================ -->

<section class="rm-hero-domain" aria-labelledby="rm-hero-domain-title">

  <div class="rm-hero-domain__bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="rm-hero-domain__topline"></div>
    <canvas class="rm-hero-domain__particles"></canvas>
    <div class="rm-hero-domain__glow rm-hero-domain__glow--blue"></div>
    <div class="rm-hero-domain__glow rm-hero-domain__glow--orange"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="rm-hero-domain__container">

    <!-- ---------- Columna de texto ---------- -->
    <div class="rm-hero-domain__content" data-animate>
      <span class="rm-hero-domain__badge">
        <span class="rm-hero-domain__badge-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Dominio &#183; .es, .com y más
      </span>

      <h1 id="rm-hero-domain-title" class="rm-hero-domain__title">
        <em>Tu nombre</em> en internet, registrado y bien cuidado
      </h1>

      <p class="rm-hero-domain__subtitle">
        Comprobamos, registramos y renovamos tu dominio. Sin caducidades olvidadas ni configuraciones técnicas: de eso nos ocupamos nosotros.
      </p>

      <p class="rm-hero-domain__hint">Registro desde X &#8364;/año &#183; Renovación y configuración incluidas</p>

      <div class="rm-hero-domain__note">
        <svg class="rm-hero-domain__note-icon" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.4-3.8 9c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.6 12 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
        </svg>
        <p>
          <strong>¿Ya tienes dominio?</strong>
          Lo traemos a Rodmedia sin cortar tu web ni tu correo.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rm-hero-domain__actions">
        <a href="#precios-dominios" class="rm-hero-domain__cta rm-hero-domain__cta--primary">
          <span>Ver precios de dominios</span>
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M3.5 8h9M8.5 3.5 13 8l-4.5 4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#contacto" class="rm-hero-domain__cta rm-hero-domain__cta--secondary">
          Reservar una llamada
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ---------- Mockup: dominio comprobado y conectado ---------- -->
    <div class="rm-hero-domain__visual" data-animate>
      <div class="rm-hero-domain__card-back" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="rm-hero-domain__card" role="img"
           aria-label="Comprobación del dominio de ejemplo clinicadentalmar.es: disponible, con renovación automática y DNS configurado, conectado a la web y al correo.">

        <div class="rm-hero-domain__shot">
          <span class="rm-hero-domain__tag">Disponible &#10003;</span>

          <div class="rm-hero-domain__omnibox">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
              <path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 3.8 5.7 3.8 9s-1.3 6.4-3.8 9c-2.5-2.6-3.8-5.7-3.8-9S9.5 5.6 12 3Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="rm-hero-domain__omnibox-text"><span class="rm-hero-domain__typing">clinicadentalmar.es</span></span>
            <span class="rm-hero-domain__omnibox-check" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </span>
          </div>

          <ul class="rm-hero-domain__features">
            <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>Renovación automática</li>
            <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12.5 9.5 18 20 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>DNS configurado</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rm-hero-domain__panel">
          <span class="rm-hero-domain__panel-label">Comprobación instantánea</span>
          <span class="rm-hero-domain__panel-title">clinicadentalmar.es</span>

          <span class="rm-hero-domain__panel-btn">
            <span class="rm-hero-domain__panel-btn-texto">Registrarlo con Rodmedia</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rm-hero-domain__notif">
        <span class="rm-hero-domain__notif-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/>
          <path d="M8.5 12.5 11 15l4.5-5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <strong>Dominio registrado</strong>
          <span>Conectado a tu web y tu correo</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,600;1,700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  .rm-hero-domain {
    --rm-primary: #0f0f1e;
    --rm-blue: #3a7bd5;
    --rm-orange: #e8531a;
    --rm-light: #f8f8fb;
    --rm-text-muted: #9aa3bd;
    --rm-radius: 8px;
    --rm-radius-lg: 20px;
    --rm-transition: 0.3s ease;
    --rm-font-display: "Playfair Display", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --rm-font-body: "Inter", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
    --rm-loop: 9s;

    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--rm-primary);
    color: var(--rm-light);
    font-family: var(--rm-font-body);
    padding: 120px 20px 100px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain *,
  .rm-hero-domain *::before,
  .rm-hero-domain *::after {
    box-sizing: inherit;
  }

  /* ---------- Fondo: línea de firma + partículas + glows ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__topline {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange), var(--rm-blue));
    background-size: 200% 100%;
    animation: rm-hero-domain-shimmer 6s linear infinite;
  }

  @keyframes rm-hero-domain-shimmer {
    0% { background-position: 0% 0; }
    100% { background-position: 200% 0; }
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__particles {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__glow {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(100px);
    opacity: 0.28;
    animation: rm-hero-domain-float 15s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__glow--blue {
    width: 480px;
    height: 480px;
    top: -150px;
    left: -110px;
    background: var(--rm-blue);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__glow--orange {
    width: 420px;
    height: 420px;
    bottom: -170px;
    right: -110px;
    background: var(--rm-orange);
    animation-delay: -7s;
  }

  @keyframes rm-hero-domain-float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
    50% { transform: translate(26px, 22px) scale(1.07); }
  }

  /* ---------- Contenedor ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 64px;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__content[data-animate],
  .rm-hero-domain__visual[data-animate] {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(24px);
    transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__content.is-visible,
  .rm-hero-domain__visual.is-visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__visual[data-animate] {
    transition-delay: 0.15s;
  }

  /* ---------- Badge ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__badge-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    animation: rm-hero-domain-blink 2.2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes rm-hero-domain-blink {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { opacity: 0.25; }
  }

  /* ---------- Titular ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__title {
    font-family: var(--rm-font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 1.4rem + 3.4vw, 3.75rem);
    line-height: 1.14;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--rm-light);
    max-width: 17ch;
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  /* inline-block con su propio line-height generoso: la caja del
     degradado no depende de qué fuente acabe cargando (real o
     cursiva fabricada por el navegador si el webfont no llega a
     tiempo), así las astas altas de la cursiva nunca se recortan */
  .rm-hero-domain__title em {
    display: inline-block;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding: 0 0.02em;
    font-style: italic;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__subtitle {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  /* ---------- Pista de precio ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__hint {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted);
  }

  /* ---------- Recuadro de garantía (ya tienes dominio) ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius-lg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    max-width: 48ch;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__note-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: var(--rm-blue);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__note p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__note strong {
    color: var(--rm-light);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ---------- CTAs ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--rm-font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius);
    padding: 15px 26px;
    transition: transform var(--rm-transition), box-shadow var(--rm-transition), border-color var(--rm-transition), color var(--rm-transition);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta--primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    color: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(58, 123, 213, 0.28);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta--primary::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(160px circle at var(--rm-mx, 50%) var(--rm-my, 50%), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.32), transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--rm-transition);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta--primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 34px rgba(232, 83, 26, 0.35);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta--primary:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta--primary span,
  .rm-hero-domain__cta--primary svg {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta--secondary {
    color: #e5e7eb;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
    background: transparent;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta--secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--rm-blue);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__cta:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--rm-blue);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* ---------- Tarjeta mockup (3D: inclinación con el cursor) ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__visual {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 420px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    perspective: 1400px;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__card-back {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: -14px;
    bottom: 26px;
    left: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius-lg);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    transform: translateZ(-70px) rotate(4deg) scale(0.96);
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius-lg);
    background: #14151f;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    animation: rm-hero-domain-idle-sway 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease-out;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__visual.is-interactive .rm-hero-domain__card {
    animation: none;
  }

  @keyframes rm-hero-domain-idle-sway {
    0%, 100% { transform: rotateY(-5deg) rotateX(2.5deg); }
    50% { transform: rotateY(5deg) rotateX(-2.5deg); }
  }

  /* Imagen superior: foto de estudio clara, igual tratamiento que los
     otros dos heros */
  .rm-hero-domain__shot {
    position: relative;
    padding: 58px 24px 26px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%, #fbfbfb, #dedee2 80%);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    left: 16px;
    z-index: 3;
    padding: 7px 13px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__omnibox {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #e2e5ea;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15, 15, 30, 0.08);
    color: #6b7290;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__omnibox-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    font-family: var(--rm-font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #1f2430;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__typing {
    display: inline-block;
    max-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    vertical-align: bottom;
    animation: rm-hero-domain-type var(--rm-loop) steps(19, end) infinite;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__omnibox-check {
    flex: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(58, 123, 213, 0.12);
    color: var(--rm-blue);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: scale(0.6);
    animation: rm-hero-domain-check-in var(--rm-loop) infinite;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__features li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #545b6e;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__features svg {
    flex: none;
    color: var(--rm-blue);
  }

  /* Panel inferior */
  .rm-hero-domain__panel {
    position: relative;
    padding: 22px 20px 24px;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__panel-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__panel-title {
    display: block;
    margin: 4px 0 16px;
    font-family: var(--rm-font-display);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--rm-light);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__panel-btn {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    padding: 13px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    transform: scale(1);
    animation: rm-hero-domain-press var(--rm-loop) infinite;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__panel-btn-texto {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ---------- Tarjeta flotante: dominio registrado ---------- */
  .rm-hero-domain__notif {
    position: absolute;
    left: -8px;
    bottom: -18px;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 20px;
    background: rgba(15, 15, 30, 0.85);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--rm-radius-lg);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    color: var(--rm-blue);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(12px);
    animation: rm-hero-domain-notif var(--rm-loop) infinite;
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__notif-dot {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10px;
    right: 12px;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--rm-blue), var(--rm-orange));
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__notif div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; }

  .rm-hero-domain__notif strong {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--rm-light);
  }

  .rm-hero-domain__notif span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--rm-text-muted);
  }

  /* ---------- Animación en bucle de la tarjeta ----------
     5–32%  se "escribe" el dominio en el buscador de la tarjeta
     34–40% aparece la marca de disponible
     42–48% se "pulsa" el botón de registrar
     50–88% el aviso "dominio registrado" queda visible
     90%    todo vuelve al inicio */
  @keyframes rm-hero-domain-type {
    0%, 5%    { max-width: 0; }
    32%, 90%  { max-width: 100%; }
